  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Expend two link depth on an enemy link. Each hostile creature who starts or willingly moves into the range of your aura makes a Wisdom saving throw. They take 3d8 psychic damage on a failed save. This lasts for one minute, or until your link breaks.</p><p><strong>Energize:</strong> Spend two link depth to increase the damage dealt to hostile creatures by 1d8. This can be used any number of times until Violence ends.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
